& [CanonicalRecord: FSC5FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for FSC5 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 1220510f-d7bf-4409-b530-35a0fb50084c
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 7c7a1856-ce93-4955-b6d6-0f9fbaf9fb9f
  + [exploded_uuid] is d2c71130-d47e-497c-9263-adf3764ab12d
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 65b27936-41dc-41ab-af74-73cbda52e8b0
  + [authority_scope] is FSC5 slice order, slice readiness, slice gates, model routing, expected outputs, verification oracles, and live-control prohibition
  + [implementation_scope] is final slice planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC4_Surface_Projection_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Operations_Safety_Spec.canonical.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/FSC5_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current FSC5 slice surface
  = must: execute FSC5-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: preserve that FSC5 slice work does not authorize live operations control
  - never: treat FSC5 slice records as implementation proof or machine-control permission

& [CanonicalFSC5SliceSet] is the final FSC5 slice sequence
  + [slice] is FSC5-S01 operations boundary and safety invariant map
  + [slice] is FSC5-S02 dry-run operation request contract
  + [slice] is FSC5-S03 resource safety and human override contract
  + [slice] is FSC5-S04 machine-control non-authority and live-control prohibition gates
  + [slice] is FSC5-S05 operations dry-run fixture plan
  + [slice] is FSC5-S06 FSC5 completion review and safety pack

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes FSC5
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalFSC5ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for FSC5
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC5-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S02 until FSC5-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S03 until FSC5-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S04 until FSC5-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S05 until FSC5-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC5-S06 until FSC5-S05 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is FSC5 operations safety pack accepted after FSC5-S06

  = must: expose only FSC5-S01 as ready right now
  = must: keep all later slices gated inside FSC5

& [CanonicalFSC5ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [FSC5-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC5-S05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC5-S01 through FSC5-S04 are accepted
  + [FSC5-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep safety semantics, human override, live-control prohibition, and final acceptance under deeper reasoning
  = should: route dry-run fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after operations safety contracts stabilize

